{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, jump, and progress. Stuck? Try flipping the world. This is all you can do in this peculiar, monochromatic space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/\u63cf\u8ff0\u7528gif.gif?t=1744364634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take You\u00a0Home\u00a0is an indie minimalist 2D platform game where you navigate by swapping the black and white and inverting gravity to find\u00a0your way forward. Your goal is to chase a mysterious black cat that occasionally appears, to see what unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap black and white and invert gravity to find your way forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80 (or more) meticulously crafted and distinct levels, woven into a simple yet touching narrative.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only three controls, making it easy to pick up and play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items for unexpected surprises?</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1744364634","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516450?t=1744364634","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/d648fba46e78dbfb7959df8975e7ff07e94c9c48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744364634","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/d648fba46e78dbfb7959df8975e7ff07e94c9c48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744364634","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3624030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move, jump, and progress. Stuck? Try flipping the world. This is all you can do in this peculiar, monochromatic space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/extras/\u63cf\u8ff0\u7528gif.gif?t=1744364634\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take You\u00a0Home\u00a0is an indie minimalist 2D platform game where you navigate by swapping the black and white and inverting gravity to find\u00a0your way forward. Your goal is to chase a mysterious black cat that occasionally appears, to see what unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swap black and white and invert gravity to find your way forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">80 (or more) meticulously crafted and distinct levels, woven into a simple yet touching narrative.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Only three controls, making it easy to pick up and play.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items for unexpected surprises?</p></li></ul>","developers":["79STUDIO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516450/b7ee0094a2b1648831f9a19a3814bac4bcb61420/header.jpg?t=1744364634","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257121441,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121441/movie480.mp4?t=1743742603","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257121441/movie_max.mp4?t=1743742603"},"name":"pv_english","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257121441/f98cfa0fe7e70e1b4d6923a4aab9cbd0f7880385/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743742603","webm":{"4